@JobTrackerAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5151

### 0. Swagger OpenAPI JSON Specification
GET {{JobTrackerAPI_HostAddress}}/swagger/v1/swagger.json
Accept: application/json

### 1. Get All Job Types
GET {{JobTrackerAPI_HostAddress}}/api/jobtypes
Accept: application/json

### 2. Get All Job Locations
GET {{JobTrackerAPI_HostAddress}}/api/joblocations
Accept: application/json

### 3. Create a New Job Application
POST {{JobTrackerAPI_HostAddress}}/api/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "company": "Contoso Tech",
  "jobTitle": "Senior .NET Developer",
  "jobTypeId": 1,
  "jobLocationId": 3,
  "physicalLocation": "Austin, TX",
  "applicationDate": "2026-11-19",
  "status": "Applied",
  "salaryRange": "$140,000 - $160,000",
  "jobUrl": "https://example.com/careers/senior-dotnet-dev",
  "contactPerson": "Jane Recruiter",
  "contactEmail": "jane@contoso.com",
  "initialNote": "Applied through LinkedIn; referral submitted by John."
}

### 4. Get All Jobs (with optional filter query)
GET {{JobTrackerAPI_HostAddress}}/api/jobs?status=Applied&jobLocationId=3
Accept: application/json

### 5. Get Job By ID (includes notes)
GET {{JobTrackerAPI_HostAddress}}/api/jobs/1
Accept: application/json

### 6. Update Job Details
PUT {{JobTrackerAPI_HostAddress}}/api/jobs/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "company": "Contoso Tech",
  "jobTitle": "Lead .NET Developer",
  "jobTypeId": 1,
  "jobLocationId": 3,
  "physicalLocation": "Austin, TX",
  "applicationDate": "2026-11-19",
  "status": "Interviewing",
  "salaryRange": "$150,000 - $170,000",
  "jobUrl": "https://example.com/careers/senior-dotnet-dev",
  "contactPerson": "Jane Recruiter",
  "contactEmail": "jane@contoso.com"
}

### 7. Patch Job Status Only
PATCH {{JobTrackerAPI_HostAddress}}/api/jobs/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Interviewing"
}

### 8. Add a Note to a Job
POST {{JobTrackerAPI_HostAddress}}/api/jobs/1/notes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "noteText": "Completed first-round technical screen with the hiring manager."
}

### 9. Get Notes for a Job
GET {{JobTrackerAPI_HostAddress}}/api/jobs/1/notes
Accept: application/json

### 10. Update a Note
PUT {{JobTrackerAPI_HostAddress}}/api/notes/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "noteText": "Completed first-round technical screen. Feedback was positive; moving to system design round."
}

### 11. Delete a Note
DELETE {{JobTrackerAPI_HostAddress}}/api/notes/1

### 12. Delete a Job
DELETE {{JobTrackerAPI_HostAddress}}/api/jobs/1
